## Title: Dungeoneer's Ledger
## Description: Shows in the Dungeon Finder which dungeons you have completed, their extra achievements and your dungeon quests, with grouping, sorting, search and one-click selection of quest dungeons.
## Author: wasd0109
## Version: 0.1.0
## AddOnVersion: 1
## APIVersion: 101051 101052
## DependsOn: LibSets>=9040 LibAddonMenu-2.0>=43
## SavedVariables: DungeoneersLedger_SavedVariables DungeonCompletion_SavedVariables

